      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutwesha kumwena nansaŋu yaZiyonaku, hinukutwesha kunooka nansaŋu yaYerusalemaku, chiŋa kuloŋa kwindi kunatamuki dehi tamu-u, niwamwinu windi wunatamuki dehi neyi inoŋu didi nakubutuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niajentili akamona kuloŋa kweyi, nianyanta ejima akamona kulema kweyi. Nineyi akakutumba ijina dadiha dakukutumba kukanwa kaYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wakekala nawa chibaŋula chalubanji muchikasa chaYehova, ninsochi yawanta muchikasa chaNzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakakutenaŋa nawa cheŋi, nawu Walekewaku; niituŋa deyi hiyakaditenaŋa anawa cheŋa, nawu Ihembuku; akakutenaŋa nawu Hefwiziba, ituŋa deyi akaditenaŋa nawuBeyula. Muloŋa Yehova nakutiyi kumuchima to-o, niituŋa deyi dakekala dasumbuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chasumbula ŋawu mujiki kudi mukwenzi, dichi chakakusu mbulawu nawa kudi anyaneyi. Chazaŋajalaŋa ayilyala namumbanda akusumbulayi, dichi chakatiyayi Nzambi yeyi kuwaha naneyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yerusalema hampwembu jeyi nashuhu dehi akwakutalatala, hiyambakamwena hela namwa ana hela nawufukuku. Enu akwakumwanukisha Yehova, bayi munookaku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bayi mumuno-okesha yenaku, chiŋa nakoleshi dehi Yerusalema, chiŋa nawubalumuni dehi hiwakushimeka hanu hamaseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nasanyiki dehi nachikasa chindi chachidiilu, nasanyiki dehi nachikasa chaŋovu jindi, nindi, Chalala hinakadiisha nawa cheŋa ayilumbu jeyi tidikuyeyuku. Antu akwacheŋi hiyakanwa nawa vinyu yeyi yiwakabakenuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaaŋuli diwu akadya, hiyakahameka Yehova. Anaaŋuli diwu akayinwa muyipaŋu yakumalalami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hitenu, hitenu muyisu yakumpwembu. Loŋeshenu njila yawantu; dimenu, dimenu muhaŋa wamukwakwa, nonojolenumu malola. Yinya mwinenu antu mpandelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, Yehova nabidiki dehi kunsa jesekinindi, Mwilenu mwana kaZiyona wamumbanda, nenu, Tala wamwinu weyiwukwinzowu. Tala, wuloku windi wudi nawu, wufwetu windi wunatwaminuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akayitenaŋa nawu Antu ajila, Antu aYehova akúulewa. Akakutenaŋa nawu Wakeŋakeŋewa, Mukala abula kulekawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
